#. Description of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "A block theme for property developers, estate agents and architecture studios. A photograph hero under a bold gradient, projects with category filters, a mosaic of homes for sale, service tiles, a testimonial slider, a blog with a sidebar, and contact and newsletter forms that need no plugin — eight colour palettes, five type pairings, visitor dark mode and WooCommerce support. Full site editing throughout."
msgstr ""

